<section class="about" id="about">
  <h2 class="about-title">{{ section.settings.heading | default: 'what is roxic?' }}</h2>
  <div class="about-content">
    {{ section.settings.body }}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-about",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "what is roxic?"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Content",
      "default": "<p>ROXIC was born in Alexandria, Virginia with nothing but grind and vision. No shortcuts, no handouts — just real work that shows in every drop we put out there.</p><p>The slogan <strong>\"ROXIC YOUR WAY.\"</strong> Speaks for itself: anyone can copy the garms or designs, but they could never copy the story, the community, the grind, or what makes us original. To everyone rocking with us — you're the reason we keep building. Welcome to ROXIC. Love.</p><p><strong>To contact us, email:</strong> <a href='mailto:support@roxic.info'>support@roxic.info</a></p><p><strong>Hours of operation:</strong> we do more than graveyard shifts.</p>"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
